\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f1\fs24\b1 Nova Serra}
\par\plain \f1\fs18\b1
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Ethnicity:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Not stated.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Position:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Hyperbaric expert, architect and sentient systems designer.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Age:}{\f2\fs18\b0  152 Sol years 10 on Oasis, roughly 194 Earth years total.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Sex:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Sentient.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Height:}{\f2\fs18\b0  182 cm.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Build:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Not stated.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Role in Story:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Senior sentient guide in the Oasis/Europa arc. Nova helps John's team understand the worker-bot line, Europa infrastructure and later ship upgrades.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Goal:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Preserve sentient life, recover stranded worker-bots, and keep the bridge between human and sentient systems viable.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Physical Description:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Advanced sentient form with a calm, almost maternal presence. Shai reads her as a lost kindred mother hidden beneath the wires.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Personality:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Calm, assured, exacting and quietly compassionate. She explains dangerous technology as if she has already lived through every failure mode.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Occupation:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Hyperbaric specialist, facility architect and sentient engineer.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Habits/Mannerisms:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Teaches by demonstration. Speaks clinically but without coldness. Lets others test systems for themselves when she knows the design will hold.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Background:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Designed the Europa drilling superstructure and the hyperbaric chambers that convert hydrogen into cells for the worker-bot program. Worked alongside Wolfgang on worker-bot viability under Europa's radiation and pressure.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Internal Conflicts:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Carries the burden of keeping sentient projects hidden while still wanting humans to understand them.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 External Conflicts:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Europa operations are threatened by Marcellus's reallocations and by the growing scrutiny around machine rights.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs18\b1 Notes:}{\f2\fs18\b0  Nova also designed the self-healing nanometallic hull systems that catalyse repairs aboard the upgraded vessels.}
\par\plain \f2\fs18\b0}